  "system": {
    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-nukite-sword",
    "description": "<p>You coat your hand in lightning making it act like a buzzsaw around your striking implement.</p>\n<p>You strike out in an arc, at every creature in range. Make a single melee Taijutsu (or Ninjutsu) attack, comparing the result vs each creatures AC, dealing either your [Unarmed Damage] or [Weapon Damage] + 2d6 lightning damage.</p>\n<p>If a target creature spends their reaction to cast a jutsu that grants them temporary hit points or a bonus to their AC, if you still score a hit, increase the damage dealt by 2d6 lightning damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d6, and the size of the cone by 5 feet.</p>",
